WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.408
Hi! Today we talk about hobbies.

2
00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:10.296
What do you like doing in your free time?

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.768
What do you do in your free time? Here are a few hobbies:

4
00:00:18.168 --> 00:00:20.720
I play football.

5
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.648
I play guitar.

6
00:00:24.048 --> 00:00:26.120
I swim.

7
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.688
I dance.

8
00:00:29.088 --> 00:00:31.160
I cook.

9
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.632
I travel.

10
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.757
We use spielen for sports and for instruments:

11
00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:44.173
play football, play the piano.

12
00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:49.451
With gern you say what you like:

13
00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:52.259
I like dancing.

14
00:00:52.659 --> 00:00:55.067
I prefer cooking.

15
00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:58.355
I like reading best.

16
00:00:58.755 --> 00:01:01.403
And I don't like jogging.

17
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:07.020
Do you like cooking? Then you say:

18
00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.972
Yes, very much!

19
00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:16.572
But: Don't you like cooking? If the answer is yes, you say doch!

20
00:01:16.972 --> 00:01:19.764
Yes I do, I like cooking!

21
00:01:20.164 --> 00:01:24.204
Doch is a yes after a negative question.

22
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:30.708
Listen: Lena and Mateo talk about hobbies.

23
00:01:31.108 --> 00:01:33.492
What do you like doing?

24
00:01:33.892 --> 00:01:36.708
I like playing football.

25
00:01:37.108 --> 00:01:39.852
Do you play guitar too?

26
00:01:40.252 --> 00:01:43.284
No, I prefer reading.

27
00:01:43.684 --> 00:01:46.116
Don't you like dancing?

28
00:01:46.516 --> 00:01:49.092
Oh yes, very much!

29
00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:57.360
Now you! What do you like doing? What don't you like doing?

30
00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:10.203
Great! Now you can:

31
00:02:10.603 --> 00:02:15.243
You talk about hobbies and say what you like doing.

32
00:02:15.643 --> 00:02:17.763
See you soon!
